{"ts": 0.244474, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m list the .txt files with a glob (ls *.txt) \u001b[90mnot yet: not in your history\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m Run the ones marked ○, then type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[0m again.\r\n", "len": 179}
